  "historyNote": "#10648, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 7-25-14, EXPIRES: 1-21-15; ss by #10761, INTERIM, eff 1-21-15, EXPIRES: 7-20-15; ss by #10847, eff 7-1-15; (formerly Saf-Mec 303.06); ss by #14482, eff 2-13-26, EXPIRES: 2-13-36",
